                                                               ; ASSERT ptr=967
                                                               ; A 128 BIT VALUE DOUBLED IN THE FIELD CMAC USES  which
                                                               ; is a left shift by one across sixteen big endian
                                                               ; bytes  followed by a conditional exclusive or of 0x87
                                                               ; into the last byte when the bit that fell off the
                                                               ; first was set;
;
                                                               ; NIST SP 800_38B section 6 point 1; It is exactly the
                                                               ; shape of aes/xtime one byte wide: double  and reduce
                                                               ; by the field's polynomial if the top bit was set; The
                                                               ; polynomial here is x^128 plus x^7 plus x^2 plus x
                                                               ; plus 1  whose low byte is 0x87  where xtime's is
                                                               ; 0x1b;
;
                                                               ; THE REDUCTION IS UNCONDITIONAL  for the reason xtime
                                                               ; gives: the top bit is taken as a VALUE  0x87 is
                                                               ; multiplied by it  and the exclusive or runs whatever
                                                               ; that came to; Exclusive or with nought is the
                                                               ; identity  so the branch SP 800_38B writes in prose
                                                               ; costs nothing beyond the multiply  and the work does
                                                               ; not depend on the value of the bit;
;
                                                               ; IN PLACE; the value goes in at cell nought through
                                                               ; cell fifteen and the answer comes back there;
                                                               ; Everything above is scratch and is left clear which
                                                               ; the exit contract states;
;
                                                               ; THE DOUBLING NEEDS NO MASK  again for xtime's reason:
                                                               ; a cell wraps at 256 and the wrap IS the shift; What a
                                                               ; byte needs from its neighbour is the neighbour's TOP
                                                               ; BIT  which is why block/topbit is included sixteen
                                                               ; times;
;
                                                               ; TAPE MAP  (relative to the block's own zero)
;   @0x00:0x0f  v  the value  big endian  v at nought most significant
;   @0x10:0x1f  d  the doubling temps  spent back into v
;   @0x20:0x2f  h  the top bits; the one at nought triggers the reduction
;   @0x30:0x33  the block/topbit frame  byte q t f
;   @0x34:0x44  idiom/xor8 pasted at 0x34; result 0x34  operands 0x35 0x36
;
                                                               ; ASSERT ptr=967
                                                               ; ASSERT zero 983:1035

; ============================================================ ; every byte goes out twice: once to be doubled  once
                                                               ; for its top bit
  [->>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>+>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>+<<<<<<   ; byte 0 of sixteen
  <<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<]                  ; continued
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>               ; to the topbit frame
                                                               ; ASSERT ptr=1015
                                                               ; THE TOP BIT OF THE BYTE AT THIS CELL  taken by
                                                               ; halving it seven times and keeping the quotient; The
                                                               ; byte is REPLACED by its top bit and the pointer comes
                                                               ; back here; q t and f sit in the three cells above
                                                               ; which is what block/halve wants  so this block needs
                                                               ; FOUR cells and not one;
;
                                                               ; IT COSTS ABOUT TWICE THE VALUE and depends on nothing
                                                               ; else  which is the property that makes it usable
                                                               ; inside a constant time argument: the work is a
                                                               ; function of the byte and not of a secret choice made
                                                               ; about it;
;
                                                               ; THIS TEXT ALREADY EXISTS IN aes/xtime  written out
                                                               ; seven times inline  and again in idiom/add8's carry;
                                                               ; NEITHER IS MIGRATED HERE and that is deliberate
                                                               ; rather than lazy: a paste reads a callee's committed
                                                               ; artifact  and xtime is pasted by four files  so the
                                                               ; comment change alone would regenerate most of the AES
                                                               ; tree for no change in instructions; HANDOFF records
                                                               ; it;
;
                                                               ; ASSERT ptr=1015
                                                               ; halving one of seven; the bit that falls off is not
                                                               ; wanted HALVE  the byte at this cell  with q t and f
                                                               ; in the three cells above it; q becomes it shifted
                                                               ; right one and t the bit that fell off; the pointer
                                                               ; comes back here; CONVENTIONS section 5 carries the
                                                               ; vocabulary entry;
