                                                               ; ASSERT ptr=31
                                                               ; ASSERT ptr=31
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; and the chain is MOVED into the state  because the
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; cipher's answer is
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; continued
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; continued
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; continued
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; continued
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; continued
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; continued
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; continued
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; continued
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; continued
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; continued
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; continued
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; continued
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; continued
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; continued
  >>>>>>                                                       ; continued
                                                               ; the next chain and would otherwise be added to what
                                                               ; was left standing SIXTEEN BYTES MOVED DOWN 885 CELLS
                                                               ; leaving the source EMPTY; Entered where the source
                                                               ; begins and it leaves the pointer on the source's last
                                                               ; cell; Every move in it is relative  so the same text
                                                               ; does the same job wherever it is included: it moves
                                                               ; src through src plus 15 into src minus 885;
;
                                                               ; THE SIBLING OF block/copy16  AND THE DIFFERENCE IS
                                                               ; THE WHOLE POINT; that one stages each byte and hands
                                                               ; it back  for an operand that is wanted again; this
                                                               ; one does not  for an operand that is SPENT by the
                                                               ; routine it feeds; A copy where a move belonged is not
                                                               ; a slow move: it leaves the old value standing where
                                                               ; the new one is about to be written  and in
                                                               ; aes/cbcenc128 that meant the next chaining value was
                                                               ; the sum of the ciphertext and the plaintext block
                                                               ; that produced it; The first block was still right
                                                               ; because a block is emitted before it is chained  so
                                                               ; only a message of TWO blocks or more could show it;
;
                                                               ; IT ALSO TOUCHES NOTHING IT DOES NOT HAVE TO;
                                                               ; block/copy16 stages 869 cells below its source  which
                                                               ; in that mode is the cipher's own round key region;
                                                               ; this routine has no stage  so those cells are never
                                                               ; written at all;
                                                               ; ASSERT ptr=967
  [-<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<
