                                                               ; working value exactly 885 cells above the cipher's
                                                               ; state  so the three routines that cross that gap are
                                                               ; one text each; block/copy16 goes DOWN and stages
                                                               ; block/move16 goes DOWN and does not  and this one
                                                               ; comes back UP;
;
                                                               ; UP IS A SEPARATE ROUTINE AND NOT A PARAMETER  because
                                                               ; an include carries an offset and not a direction: the
                                                               ; offset shifts where a block's frame starts and cannot
                                                               ; turn R885 into L885; That is the same limit
                                                               ; block/copy16's header records about distances  seen
                                                               ; from the other side;
;
                                                               ; ASSERT ptr=82
